|---|---|
| **All-or-nothing validation** | Every request is validated in a loop *before* any DML list is populated or executed. A single bad request throws `SoftCreditException` and nothing is written. |
| **Exactly one OCR with the right role** | The existing OCR (if any) for that (opp, contact) pair is reused. If its `Role` differs from the requested role it is updated; if none exists a new one is inserted. Because the precondition guarantees no duplicate (opp, contact) pairs, the map key is unambiguous. |
