| **Governor limits (200 requests)** | 3 SOQL queries (Opportunities, OCRs, PCS) + at most 4 DML statements (insert OCR, update OCR, insert PCS, update PCS) = well within the 4 / 4 budget. |
| **Null / empty input** | Early `return` when the list is null or empty. |

